# For dumps that open on a cracker's intro or trainer screen that waits for the left button
# (docs/dumps.md). Same as earth-base.input after the first two directives; the shot name is the same.
wait 200
click
until colours 16
wait 50
click
until colours 4
wait 20
key 1
# The data-disk prompt prints a character at a time; a key before it finishes is ignored.
wait 400
disk df0 disk2
wait 20
key space
until colours 18 6000
wait 100
sprites off
wait 2
shot earth-base-nosprite
quit
